  "details": "Since some time - mainly as it became very public to users on cheating in VRChat aka avoiding the limit - it became annoying to barely be able to walk around without someone spamming his stupid Overlay effect aka Black Screen or Whirl Effect.\n\nNot only that these people often get away free (because obviously you don't see anything) banning them just results in avoiding so on a new account.\n\nSo my request is make make Render Queue (over 2000-3000), Tesselation, Vertex manipulation, Refraction and Lights only be available to people with at least 168 hours of gametime. While I'm totally for freedom, people that are new to the game most likely don't have any use to these features anyway and people that behave correct will be rewarded.\n\nPS: Add HWID bans as standard.\n\nThis would reduce griefing by at least 900%",
